# Editor backups, autosaves and scratch copies. Emacs writes `file~`,
# `#file#` and `.#file`; vim writes `.file.swp`; patch/merge tools leave
# `.orig`/`.rej` behind; `.bak`/`.old`/`.tmp.*` are hand-made copies.
*~
*#
.#*
*.sw[a-p]
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.old
*.tmp.*
